                                "sense_id": "a5b4738e-a45b-3c94-8392-68181588b06a",
                                "text": "In der Schweiz liegen die Saläre höher als in den Nachbarländern.",
                                "translation": "Salaries in Switzerland are higher than in the neighbouring countries.",
                                "english": "Salaries in Switzerland are higher than in the neighbouring countries."
                            },
