                                "sense_id": "a5b4738e-a45b-3c94-8392-68181588b06a",
                                "text": "Mancher Topmanager versucht sein schmales Salär mit Insidergeschäften aufzubessern.",
                                "translation": "Many a top manager tries to supplement his slender salary through insider trading.",
